{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302340","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130234001:1":{"text":"이렇게 뚜껑이 높은 뚝배기 냄비예요.","source_cn":"就是这种拥有高盖帽的陶土锅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C7DAC65EE3E458C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130234002:1":{"text":"사막식 바베큐가 질렸을 때 냄비에 야채를 끓여서 스튜로 드셔 보세요.","source_cn":"当你吃腻了荒漠的烤肉时，就可以考虑使用它做些富含汤汁的炖菜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F052899D521C590","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130234003:1":{"text":"다만 사용하기 전에 냄비에 기름칠을 하지 않으면 쉽게 타버려요.","source_cn":"但是使用前记得给锅刷油，不然锅底很容易变得黑糊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B9512ED0F9AE0B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人狄美尔":{"text":"상인 디메르","source":"商人狄美尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}